</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Properties><Property><Name>TcPlcInterfaceType</Name></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name Decoration="1008FB2C">TcUnit.FB_AdjustAssertFailureMessageToMax253CharLength</Name><Comment><![CDATA[
    This function block is responsible for making sure that the asserted test instance path and test message are not
    loo long. The total printed message can not be more than 253 characters long.
]]></Comment><BitSize>9600</BitSize><SubItem><Name>TestInstancePath</Name><Type Decoration="40000100">STRING(255)</Type><BitSize>2048</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>TestMessage</Name><Type Decoration="40000100">STRING(255)</Type><BitSize>2048</BitSize><BitOffs>2112</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>TestInstancePathProcessed</Name><Type Decoration="40000100">STRING(255)</Type><BitSize>2048</BitSize><BitOffs>4160</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>TestMessageProcessed</Name><Type Decoration="40000100">STRING(255)</Type><BitSize>2048</BitSize><BitOffs>6208</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>TEST_NAME_TOO_LONG</Name><Type Decoration="40000051">STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize><BitOffs>8256</BitOffs><Default><String>...TestName too long</String></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name>TEST_MESSAGE_TOO_LONG</Name><Type Decoration="40000051">STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize><BitOffs>8904</BitOffs><Default><String>...TestMsg too long</String></Default></SubItem><FbInfo /><Properties><Property><Name>PouType</Name><Value>FunctionBlock</Value></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name Decoration="100284A8">TcUnit.FB_AdsAssertMessageFormatter</Name><Comment><![CDATA[
    This function block is responsible for printing the results of the assertions using the built-in
    ADSLOGSTR functionality provided by the Tc2_System library. This sends the result using ADS, which
    is consumed by the error list of Visual Studio.
